  <description>Grey distance-reference box: 0.5 m (X) x 1.0 m (Y) x 1.0 m (Z). A test fixture for verifying laser ranging, NOT a race prop. Origin: centre of the bottom face; pose z=0 stands on the ground, so at pose x=8.0 the front (+X-facing) surface is at x=7.75 m.</description>
